('a50836b9-6ec4-5d8c-bcfa-7cdcd713ee5e','Honda','CRF250RX',2022,'standard','US','service','Maintenance schedule / Fuel line / Inspect: Each race or about 3.5 hours. Value printed for the CRF250RX in this handbook, which also covers other variants. Stock OEM parts only. From this model''s column of the handbook maintenance schedule, whichever of races or hours is printed; the schedule assumes average riding conditions and severe use needs more frequent service. Legend: I = inspect and clean, adjust, lubricate or replace if necessary; C = clean; R = replace; L = lubricate. Schedule note: replace every year.','https://cdn.powersports.honda.com/documentum/MWOM/ml.remawmom.2022_crf250r_rx_competition_handbook.pdf','PDF page 29; printed 2-11; Maintenance schedule / Fuel line / Inspect','VERIFIED',false,'{"id": "a50836b9-6ec4-5d8c-bcfa-7cdcd713ee5e", "domain": "service", "review": {"decision": "approved", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-25T00:00:00Z", "reviewer_id": "BAK MX manufacturer source review (pass 2: document text layer plus rendered page-image check)", "scope_checked": true, "content_checked": true, "conflicts_checked": true, "approval_reference": "docs/research/expansion/honda/pass2/REVIEW.md; OEM document from Honda''s CDN, hashed; value matched to the text layer of the cited page by extract_pass2.py and the page image checked; model assignment as recorded in the review; no same-scope row on file.", "approved_applicability": {"model": "CRF250RX", "region": "US", "variant": "standard", "model_year": 2022, "manufacturer": "Honda"}, "approved_document_sha256": "6bb82e92779c1a6dab33314b6dcb8b02cf2baf14f43edd13bac088447a7b060d"}, "rights": {"basis": "factual_extraction", "reference": "Existing BAK MX US factual-extraction policy; docs/research/expansion/honda/pass2/REVIEW.md", "usage_scope": "facts_only_no_source_distribution", "commercial_use_approved": true}, "source": {"url": "https://cdn.powersports.honda.com/documentum/MWOM/ml.remawmom.2022_crf250r_rx_competition_handb